<li><strong>Third Battle of Panipat</strong> <span style='color: var(--warning);'>1761</span> – <strong>Ahmad Shah Durrani</strong> defeated <strong>Afghan ruler</strong> vs <strong>Marathas</strong>; <strong>Rani Padmini</strong>? Not relevant here. <strong>Peshwa Balaji Baji Rao</strong> died before battle; <strong>Sadashivrao Bhau</strong> led forces.</li>
